        "text_xtLQE8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At PackTHC, we specialize in providing high-quality, compliant packaging solutions tailored for the wellness industry. Our product line includes pop-top vials, glass and plastic jars, concentrate containers, and protective gear.</p><p>We proudly serve businesses of all sizes—from emerging brands to large-scale enterprises—offering reliable, durable, and cost-effective packaging designed to meet both functional and regulatory needs.<br/><br/>Quality is at the core of everything we do. Every product in our inventory is handpicked to meet the highest standards of durability, safety, and performance.</p><p>We recognize the importance of packaging in preserving product integrity, enhancing brand reputation, and ensuring customer trust. That’s why we only partner with trusted manufacturers to bring you packaging you can rely on.</p>",
